    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Queen Eduhauana personally brainwashes forty-eight Igigi (including Pazuzu) with surgical false narratives to spread targeted suspicions among Giant factions; Pazuzu involuntarily plants the first suspicion in Ishara."
  - line: 13
